    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mysterious journey to the Red Planet, searching for playful cats hidden throughout space stations, research facilities, and bustling Mars colonies. Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:<br>\u2022 Over 100 unique cats waiting to be discovered<br>\u2022 Beautifully hand-drawn Martian scenes, from desert dunes to high-tech dome cities<br>\u2022 Relaxing soundtrack inspired by sci-fi space music<br>\u2022 Perfect for short breaks - find a few cats at a time, save your progress, and return anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from daily life with this casual hidden object game. Each cat has its own unique personality and hiding style, making every discovery a delightful surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Base game includes one complete level.</p>",
